      "author_association": "NONE",
      "body": "To compile the server:\n\n- Go to `3rdparty/llama.cpp`\n- Run: `mkdir build && cmake -B build && cmake --build build --config Release --target llama-server`\n\nIf the compilation success, the binary will be available in `build/bin`.  ",
